    "name": "Shipmozo Shipping API",
    "description": "Shipmozo REST API — orders, couriers, tracking, warehouses, NDR, and labels.\n\n1. Import a **Shipmozo Dev** or **Shipmozo Live** environment (or set `baseUrl` yourself).\n2. Set `public-key` and `private-key` from Panel → Profile.\n3. Send requests — check `result` (`1` = success, `0` = failure).\n\nGenerated from the developer portal OpenAPI spec.",
